<title>USA: SpectraScience elects McMahon chairman.</title>
<headline>SpectraScience elects McMahon chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>SpectraScience Inc said Tuesday that Brian McMahon, who has been acting chairman of the board, was elected chairman.</p>
<p>McMahon continues as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>SpectraScience develops minimally-invasive medical delivery systems.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
